              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EI wired each element type to its own Razor partial so the Block Grid can breathe in both light and dark modes. Tailwind handles the glass reflections while the partials keep logic clean.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "4020c981-3adb-468c-80bb-0869718c098e",
